    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectReached? THEN\n\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectSmall? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO InspectObject\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tDO PerformSpecificTask\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO MoveToDestination\n\tEND\n"
